# The café's jukebox on the PlayStation's tracks (fixtures/jukebox: the
# sweep's save of scene 76 with Twinsen in the zone that leads to the
# café, scene 80, the game's flag 90 set, and the lba.cfg of soundout
# with MusicJingles: PlayStation, on the CD psmusic). Scene 76 plays its
# tune 13 as J03MID, which plays on into the café, whose tune is the
# same, until the jukebox's script turns the music off and plays the
# CD's track 9. F6 then opens the option menu, and Return to game plays
# track 9 again.
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 15
shot cafe
hold 0.05
key F6
sleep 3
shot options
key Return
sleep 5
shot back
